Package: mavescape
Type: Package
Title: Remote Control of a Running 'MaveScape'
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("Robert", "McDermott", email = "robert.c.mcdermott@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drives 'MaveScape', a workbench for multiplexed assays of variant
    effect (deep mutational scans), from R: every action an AI agent can take
    in 'MaveScape' (open count and score tables, describe the experiment's
    design, score, read the quality control, select variants, compare runs and
    score sets, make figures, export files) is an R function that the open
    'MaveScape' window performs, so the analysis stays visible and recorded.
    Tables come back as data frames and pictures as files.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/MaveScape
BugReports: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/MaveScape/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
